# Encounter overrides for the Starboard Section (I28; our own data, see
# crates/session/src/encounters.rs; never written into the game install).
#
# I22's co-op variant (section 11): four Sith Troopers and a heavy trooper
# near where Carth joins, then two Sith and a trooper further on. Its rule
# holds for any number of players: each player past the first adds half
# again of every hostile's maximum, and from three players one more
# trooper stands with the four (beside the first of them).
per_player hp x0.5
add end_sith01 end_sith01_coop by 1.0 0.0 0.0 if players >= 3
